This repository is a development workspace meta-repo. It contains only a
manifest, helper scripts, and documentation; it clones KubeRocketCI component
repositories at bootstrap time into the (git-ignored) sources/ directory. Those
components are NOT redistributed by this repository — each remains under its own
license in its own upstream repository (epam/* and KubeRocketCI/*). Please
consult each component's upstream project for its license terms.
